  Apache SkyWalking query protocol. The GraphQL queries, input types and
  field names used by the query client (listServices, findService,
  findEndpoint, listInstances, queryTraces, queryTrace, queryLogs,
  queryLogTagAutocompleteKeys, getGlobalTopology, getServiceTopology,
  getTimeInfo, checkHealth, version) are written from the GraphQL schema of
  the SkyWalking query protocol (https://github.com/apache/skywalking-query-protocol),
  Copyright The Apache Software Foundation, licensed under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0. The native log data format of POST /v3/logs follows
  the SkyWalking data collect protocol
  (https://github.com/apache/skywalking-data-collect-protocol, Apache License,
  Version 2.0). No SkyWalking source code is included.

  sw8 header format. The sw8 and sw8-correlation codecs implement the
  "Cross Process Propagation Headers Protocol v3" and "Cross Process
  Correlation Headers Protocol v1" documented by Apache SkyWalking
  (https://skywalking.apache.org/docs/main/latest/en/api/x-process-propagation-headers-v3/),
  Copyright The Apache Software Foundation, licensed under the Apache
  License, Version 2.0.

  Zipkin v2 query API. OTLP spans are read back from OAP's Zipkin-compatible
  query API; the span JSON model and query parameters follow the Zipkin API
  specification (https://github.com/openzipkin/zipkin-api), Copyright The
  OpenZipkin Authors, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

  OpenTelemetry protocol (OTLP). Spans are exported with the OTLP protobuf
  definitions (https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-proto),
  Copyright The OpenTelemetry Authors, licensed under the Apache License,
  Version 2.0, through the generated bindings of the OpenTelemetry libraries
  of each language (opentelemetry-js, opentelemetry-rust / opentelemetry-proto,
  go.opentelemetry.io/proto/otlp, opentelemetry-proto for Python,
  opentelemetry-java), which are runtime dependencies under the same licence.

  Test fixtures. The recorded request/response fixtures in the test folders
  were captured from apache/skywalking-oap-server:10.4.0 (Apache License,
  Version 2.0) running locally with synthetic data.
